# Restore staging/holding folders (core/backup.js stageRestore/swapInStagedRestore).
# They sit NEXT TO the live store, which on a source run is ./data — so a crash
# mid-restore can leave a full copy of the user's db (settings + API keys) and
# image library in the repo root. Never committable.
